@licithub_api_usuarios_HostAddress = http://localhost:5285

### Registrar usuário
POST {{licithub_api_usuarios_HostAddress}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Usuário de Teste",
  "email": "usuario@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "SenhaSegura123"
}

### Login
POST {{licithub_api_usuarios_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "SenhaSegura123"
}

### Renovar token
POST {{licithub_api_usuarios_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "COLE_O_REFRESH_TOKEN_AQUI"
}

### Usuário autenticado
GET {{licithub_api_usuarios_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### Logout
POST {{licithub_api_usuarios_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

###
